text	agCountryItemText	diva	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "id", "value": "agCountryItemText"}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "diva"}]}, {"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "divaText"}]}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2024-06-14T11:00:03.897078Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2024-06-14T11:00:03.897078Z"}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Argentina"}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Argentina"}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
text	agentHelpText	diva	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "divaText"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "diva"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "agentHelpText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2025-10-09T12:15:17.497785Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2026-03-27T12:19:08.054676Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Om publikationen är utgiven av en utgivare registrerad i DiVA, skapa en länk genom att söka efter utgivaren. Externa utgivare kan läggas till genom fritextfält (annan utgivare). Anges flera utgivare via länk och/eller fritext ska gruppen upprepas, en grupp för varje utgivare."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "If the publication is published by a publisher registered in DiVA, create a link by searching for the publisher. External publishers can be added through a free text field (other agent). If multiple publishers are specified via link and/or free text, the group should be repeated, one group for each publisher."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
text	aheadOfPrintItemDefText	diva	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "divaText"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "diva"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "aheadOfPrintItemDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2024-08-27T09:41:56.975741Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2024-08-27T09:41:56.975741Z"}], "repeatId": "0"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2024-08-27T10:01:54.610889Z"}], "repeatId": "1"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2025-01-13T10:14:21.497891Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}], "repeatId": "2"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Publikationer som har tillgängliggjorts före formell publiceringen. Till exempel artiklar utan beständiga bibliografiska uppgifter på plats (sidantal, nummer, volym etc) som har tillgängliggjorts innan tidskriftsnumret de skall in i är färdiggjort. Definition hämtad från https://id.kb.se/term/swepub/EpubAheadOfPrintOnlineFirst"}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Publications made available before formal publication. For example, articles without permanent bibliographic information in place (page number, number, volume, etc.) that have been made available before the journal number they are to be a part of is completed. Definition retrieved from https://id.kb.se/term/swepub/EpubAheadOfPrintOnlineFirst"}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
