text	classic_reportUpdateGroupDefText	diva	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "divaText"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "diva"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "classic_reportUpdateGroupDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2026-04-29T11:13:49.679171Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2026-04-29T11:13:49.679171Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Publicerad rapport. Antingen publicerad fristående eller ingående i en rapportserie. Redogörelser av en undersökning eller ett utfört uppdrag, till exempel redovisning av ett forskningsprojekt, som publiceras av den organisation som har gett uppdraget och/eller finansierat projektet eller den organisation där författarna är verksamma. Rapporter har sällan genomgått sakkunniggranskning inför publiceringen. KB - Svensk indelning av forskningsoutput 2023 [Detta är en kopia som håller DiVA classics valideringsnivå]"}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Published report. Either published independently or as part of a series of reports. Accounts of a study or a completed assignment, for example an account of a research project, which are published by the organization that commissioned and/or financed the project or the organization where the authors work. Reports have rarely undergone peer review prior to publication. KB - Svensk indelning av forskningsoutput 2023 [This is a copy that meets DiVA classics validation level.]"}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
