text	diva_degree-projectDefText	diva	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "divaText"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "diva"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "diva_degree-projectDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2025-03-12T15:36:20.916688Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2025-09-24T09:14:20.807282Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Studentuppsats (självständigt arbete) för examen på grundnivå och avancerad nivå. Ett examensarbete kallas i vissa sammanhang för självständigt arbete och i ledigare språkbruk för exjobb. Inom konstnärliga utbildningar används ibland mer specifika termer för vissa separata delar, till exempel examensutställning, examenskonsert eller examensprojekt. UHR - ordbok"}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Student thesis (independent project), for degrees at first and second level. In some contexts, a degree project is called independent project and in more casual parlance an ex-job. Within artistic education, more specific terms are sometimes used for certain separate parts, for example degree exhibition, degree concert or degree project. UHR - ordbok"}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
