text	divaMemberAdminRoleText	diva	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "divaText"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "diva"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "divaMemberAdminRoleText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2025-11-13T13:28:34.012112Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2025-11-14T15:44:31.954184Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Roll för medlemsadministratör i DiVA"}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Role of member administrator in DiVA"}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
text	divaMemberAdminRuleDefText	diva	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "divaText"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "diva"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "divaMemberAdminRuleDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2025-11-13T13:31:13.727186Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2026-02-11T09:09:50.794819Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Medlemsadministratör får skapa, läsa, uppdatera, ta bort, söka och validera posttyperna output, del av organisation, person, projekt, serie, ämne, kurs, program och lokala etiketter som tillhör den egna medlemmen. En medlemsadministratör kan också läsa och uppdatera lokalt id för person i posttypen person samt läsa och skriva i gruppen adminInfo och fältet note och reviewed i gruppen attachments i output."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Member administrator may create, read, update, delete, search, and validate the output, part of organization, person, project, series, subject, course, program, and local labels record types belonging to their own member. A member administrator can also read and update the local ID for the person in the person record type as well as read and write in the adminInfo group and the note and reviewed fields in the attachments group in output."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
