text	filesReviewedCollectionDefText	diva	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "divaText"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "diva"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "filesReviewedCollectionDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2026-02-05T14:53:56.815504Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2026-02-05T15:07:42.826769Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Filer granskade av en administratör, ja eller nej. Är värdet ja (true) när publikationsposten sparas sätts värdet för filens synlighet om till publicerad för filer som har värdet \\"Tillgänglig\\" i fältet \\"Avsedd tillgänglighet\\". Filer som har värdet \\"Ej tillgänglig\\" eller \\"Sekretess\\" i fältet \\"Avsedd tillgänglighet\\" förblir värdet för filens synlighet opublicerad."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Files reviewed by an administrator, yes or no. If the value is true when the publication record is saved, the file visibility value is set to published for files that have the value \\"Available\\" in the \\"Intended Availability\\" field. For files that have the value \\"Unavailable\\" or \\"Confidential\\" in the \\"Intended Availability\\" field, the file visibility value remains unpublished."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
