text	flmItemDefText	diva	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "id", "value": "flmItemDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "divaText"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "diva"}]}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2024-04-04T09:14:41.754676Z"}], "repeatId": "0"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2024-09-02T12:10:07.445900Z"}], "repeatId": "1"}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2024-04-04T09:14:41.754676Z"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Agent som efter manus och i ett kreativt samarbete med regissören, väljer ut, arrangerar och monterar det filmade materialet, kontrollerar synkroniseringen av bild och ljud och deltar i andra efterproduktionsuppgifter som ljudmixning och bearbetning av visuella effekter. Idag utförs bildredigering ofta digitalt."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "A person who, following the script and in creative cooperation with the Director, selects, arranges, and assembles the filmed material, controls the synchronization of picture and sound, and participates in other post-production tasks such as sound mixing and visual effects pr