text	languageTermCollectionVarDefText	diva	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "divaText"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "diva"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "languageTermCollectionVarDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2024-11-01T11:03:23.882535Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2025-11-07T12:30:39.987268Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Publikationens språk. Variabeln använder fältet ”languageTerm” hämtat från MODS, där ”languageTerm” innehåller den textuella eller kodade formen för språket för innehållet i resursen. Kombinationen av ”languageTerm” variabeln och dess attribut ”type” med värdet låst till ”code” anger kodad form för språket och attributet ”authority” anger en auktoritativ lista över termer, i det här fallet baseras listan över språk koder i huvudsak på ISO 639-2/b"}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "The language of the publication. Variable uses the field “languageTerm” taken from MODS, where “languageTerm” contains the textual or coded form for the language of the content of the resource. The combination of the “languageTerm” variable and its attribute “type” with the value locked to “code” indicates the coded form for the language and the attribute “authority” indicates an authoritative list of terms, in this case the list of language codes is mainly based on ISO 639-2/b"}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
