t"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "the variable uses the \\"name\\" field taken from MODS, where \\"name\\" is used as the container element for the name of a person, organisation, or event (conference, meeting, etc.) associated with the resource. The combination of the \\"name\\" variable and its attribute \\"type\\" with the value locked to \\"corporate\\" indicates that the field is used for information about a company, institution, group or organisation"}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
