text	nameOrganisationHelpText	diva	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "divaText"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "diva"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "nameOrganisationHelpText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2025-10-08T14:04:53.134838Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2025-10-21T13:02:45.582973Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Om publikationens upphov är en organisation registrerad i DiVA, skapa en länk genom att söka efter organisationen. Extern organisation kan läggas till genom fritextfält (namn, ROR, beskrivning). Anges både länkad organisation och fritext ska gruppen upprepas, en grupp för varje organisation."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "If the publication's origin is an organisation registered in DiVA, create a link by searching for the organisation. External organisation can be added through a free text field (name, ROR, description). If both linked organisation and free text are specified, the group must be repeated, one group for each organisation."}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
text	nameOrganisationPatentHolderGroupDefText	diva	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "divaText"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "diva"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "nameOrganisationPatentHolderGroupDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2025-09-03T12:57:04.991410Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2025-09-03T12:59:32.447873Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Den organisation som beviljades det patent som avses i artikeln. Variabeln använder fältet ”name” hämtat från MODS, där ”name” används som containerelement för namnet på en person, organisation eller händelse (konferens, möte etc.) som är kopplat till resursen. Kombinationen av ”name” variablen och dess attribut ”type” med värdet låst till ”corporate” anger att fältet används för information om ett företag, institution, grupp eller organisation."}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "The organization that was granted the patent referred to by the item. The variable uses the \\"name\\" field taken from MODS, where \\"name\\" is used as the container element for the name of a person, organisation, or event (conference, meeting, etc.) associated with the resource. The combination of the \\"name\\" variable and its attribute \\"type\\" with the value locked to \\"corporate\\" indicates that the field is used for information about a company, institution, group or organisation"}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
