text	originalCreativeWorkUpdateGroupDefText	diva	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "divaText"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "diva"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "originalCreativeWorkUpdateGroupDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2025-09-08T08:54:14.261436Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2025-09-24T08:38:52.544561Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Konstnärligt arbete. Konstnärligt arbete där upphovspersonen är knuten till ett lärosäte. Alla typer av konstnärliga verk, även inspelningar och liveframförande. Hit musikkompositioner, bildkonst, design, arkitektur, konsthantverk, artists’ books, film, video, TV, radio, performance, teater, musik, dans, cirkus, curerade/producerade utställningar/events samt skönlitteratur som inte har publicerats som textbaserad publikation. KB - Svensk indelning av forskningsoutput 2023"}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Artistic work. Artistic work where the author is affiliated with an institution of higher education. All types of artistic works, including recordings and live performances. This includes musical compositions, visual arts, design, architecture, crafts, artists’ books, film, video, TV, radio, performance, theatre, music, dance, circus, curated/produced exhibitions/events and fiction that has not been published as a text-based publication. KB - Svensk indelning av forskningsoutput 2023"}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
