text	preprintUpdateGroupDefText	diva	{"name": "text", "children": [{"name": "recordInfo", "children": [{"name": "validationType", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "validationType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "divaText"}]}, {"name": "dataDivider", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "system"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "diva"}]}, {"name": "id", "value": "preprintUpdateGroupDefText"}, {"name": "type", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "recordType"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "text"}]}, {"name": "createdBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}, {"name": "tsCreated", "value": "2025-05-21T08:45:10.790973Z"}, {"name": "updated", "children": [{"name": "tsUpdated", "value": "2025-09-24T09:19:35.505604Z"}, {"name": "updatedBy", "children": [{"name": "linkedRecordType", "value": "user"}, {"name": "linkedRecordId", "value": "161616"}]}], "repeatId": "0"}]}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Avser tillgängliggjorda preprints som inte ännu har genomgått sakkunniggranskning inför publicering i en tidskrift. Även författarens version av manuskript som har publicerats i digitala institutionella eller ämnesarkiv, till exempel ArXiv, och eventuellt blivit tilldelade beständiga identifikatorer, så som DOI, före processen för sakkunniggranskning inför publicering i en tidskrift. KB - Svensk indelning av forskningsoutput 2023"}], "attributes": {"lang": "sv", "type": "default"}}, {"name": "textPart", "children": [{"name": "text", "value": "Refers to preprints made available that have not yet undergone peer review for publication in a journal. Also includes the author's version of manuscripts that have been published in digital institutional or subject repositories, such as ArXiv, and may have been assigned persistent identifiers, such as DOI, prior to the peer review process for publication in a journal. KB - Svensk indelning av forskningsoutput 2023"}], "attributes": {"lang": "en", "type": "alternative"}}]}
